        "root_concepts": "[quadratic, reciprocity]",
        "section": "number-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Quadratic Reciprocity",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Why (p-1)/2? The map x ↦ x² on (Z/pZ)* is 2-to-1:\n  x² = (-x)² mod p (since (-1)² = 1)\n  So the image has (p-1)/2 elements — exactly the QRs."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-QUADRATIC-RECIPROCITY.md#010",
      "path": [
        "04-QUADRATIC-RECIPROCITY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
