        "root_concepts": "[quadratic, reciprocity]",
        "section": "number-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Quadratic Reciprocity",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Case 1: p ≡ 3 (mod 4)  [simplest]\n  √a ≡ a^{(p+1)/4} (mod p)\n  (Because (a^{(p+1)/4})² = a^{(p+1)/2} = a · a^{(p-1)/2} = a · 1 = a)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-QUADRATIC-RECIPROCITY.md#014",
      "path": [
        "04-QUADRATIC-RECIPROCITY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:number-theory:04-quadratic-reciprocity, git-history:number-theory:04-quadratic-reciprocity]",
