        "root_concepts": "[quadratic, reciprocity]",
        "section": "number-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Quadratic Reciprocity",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Case 2: p ≡ 1 (mod 4)  [requires Tonelli-Shanks]\n  Write p-1 = 2^s · q with q odd.\n  Find a non-residue n (random search, 50% chance each try).\n  Use lifting algorithm to compute √a.\n  O(log² p) expected."
    },
    {
