      "text": "```\nFor distinct odd primes p and q:"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-QUADRATIC-RECIPROCITY.md#027",
      "path": [
        "04-QUADRATIC-RECIPROCITY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
