        "title": "Quadratic Reciprocity",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Direct: compute 3^5 mod 11.\n  3^2=9, 3^4=81≡4, 3^5≡12≡1 (mod 11). So (3/11) = 1. Yes."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-QUADRATIC-RECIPROCITY.md#033",
      "path": [
