      "text": "Using QR:\n  p=3 ≡ 3 (mod 4), q=11 ≡ 3 (mod 4). Both ≡ 3 (mod 4).\n  So (3/11) = -(11/3) = -(11 mod 3 / 3) = -(2/3)\n  2 mod 3: is 2 a QR mod 3? 1²=1, 2²=4≡1 → only QR is 1. So (2/3) = -1.\n  (3/11) = -(-1) = 1 ✓\n```"
